{"id":"reference/union","kind":"langref","title":"union","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#union","file":"reference/union.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"union","text":"union"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Tagged-union","text":"标记联合"},{"depth":3,"slug":"extern-union","text":"extern union"},{"depth":3,"slug":"packed-union","text":"packed union"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Anonymous-Union-Literals","text":"匿名联合字面量"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"union\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#union\">union</a></h2>\n\n      <p>裸 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span></code> 以字段列表定义一个值可能具有的类型集合。同一时刻只有一个字段可以处于活动状态。裸联合的内存表示没有保证，因此不能用它重新解释内存。如需这样做，应使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#ptrCast\">@ptrCast</a>，或者具有明确内存布局保证的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#extern-union\">extern union</a> 或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#packed-union\">packed union</a>。<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Wrong-Union-Field-Access\">访问非活动字段</a>属于需要安全检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_wrong_union_access.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Payload = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span> {\n    int: <span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span>,\n    float: <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>,\n    boolean: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"simple union\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> payload = Payload{ .int = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span> };\n    payload.float = <span class=\"tok-number\">12.34</span>;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_wrong_union_access.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_wrong_union_access.test.simple union...thread 702527 panic: access of union field 'float' while field 'int' is active\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_wrong_union_access.zig:8:12: 0x124c5b2 in test.simple union (test_wrong_union_access.zig)\n    payload.float = 12.34;\n           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:295:25: 0x1200951 in mainTerminal (test_runner.zig)\n        if (test_fn.func()) |_| {\n                        ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:74:28: 0x1200132 in main (test_runner.zig)\n        return mainTerminal(init);\n                           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:789:88: 0x11fc8cf in callMain (std.zig)\n    if (fn_info.param_types[0].? == std.process.Init.Minimal) return wrapMain(root.main(.{\n                                                                                       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11fc2b1 in _start (std.zig)\n    asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {\n    ^\nerror: the following test command terminated with signal ABRT:\n/home/andy/src/zig/.zig-cache/o/3cd42cabbbbd074f62109e69e5f19f42/test --seed=0x62c14365\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>对整个联合赋值可以激活另一个字段：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_simple_union.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Payload = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span> {\n    int: <span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span>,\n    float: <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>,\n    boolean: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"simple union\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> payload = Payload{ .int = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>, payload.int);\n    payload = Payload{ .float = <span class=\"tok-number\">12.34</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">12.34</span>, payload.float);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_simple_union.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_simple_union.test.simple union...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>要对联合使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#switch\">switch</a>，它必须是<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#Tagged-union\">标记联合</a>或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#packed-union\">packed union</a>。</p>\n      <p>当标记名称在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知时，初始化联合的方法参见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#unionInit\">@unionInit</a>。</p>\n\n      <h3 id=\"Tagged-union\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#Tagged-union\">标记联合</a></h3>\n\n      <p>联合可以声明枚举标记类型，使其成为<em>标记</em>联合，从而能够用于 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#switch\">switch</a> 表达式。匹配标记联合时，可通过额外捕获取得标记值。标记联合可以强制转换为其标记类型，参见<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion-Unions-and-Enums\">类型强制转换：联合与枚举</a>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_tagged_union.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ComplexTypeTag = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    ok,\n    not_ok,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ComplexType = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(ComplexTypeTag) {\n    ok: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    not_ok: <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch on tagged union\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> c = ComplexType{ .ok = <span class=\"tok-number\">42</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(ComplexTypeTag.ok, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(ComplexTypeTag, c));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (c) {\n        .ok =&gt; |value| <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">42</span>, value),\n        .not_ok =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (c) {\n        .ok =&gt; |_, tag| {\n            <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 由于位于 '.ok' 分支，编译时已知 'tag' 为 '.ok'：</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> std.debug.assert(tag == .ok);\n        },\n        .not_ok =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"get tag type\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(ComplexTypeTag, std.meta.Tag(ComplexType));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_tagged_union.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_tagged_union.test.switch on tagged union...OK\n2/2 test_tagged_union.test.get tag type...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>如果要在 switch 表达式中修改标记联合的载荷，在变量名前添加 <code>*</code>，使其成为指针：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_modify_tagged_union.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ComplexTypeTag = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    ok,\n    not_ok,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ComplexType = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(ComplexTypeTag) {\n    ok: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    not_ok: <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"modify tagged union in switch\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> c = ComplexType{ .ok = <span class=\"tok-number\">42</span> };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (c) {\n        ComplexTypeTag.ok =&gt; |*value| value.* += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>,\n        ComplexTypeTag.not_ok =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">43</span>, c.ok);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_modify_tagged_union.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_switch_modify_tagged_union.test.modify tagged union in switch...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>可以让联合推导枚举标记类型。此外，联合与结构体、枚举一样，也可以包含方法。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_union_method.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Variant = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>) {\n    int: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>,\n    boolean: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 推导枚举标记类型时可以省略 void。</span>\n    none,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">truthy</span>(self: Variant) <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (self) {\n            Variant.int =&gt; |x_int| x_int != <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n            Variant.boolean =&gt; |x_bool| x_bool,\n            Variant.none =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        };\n    }\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"union method\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> v1: Variant = .{ .int = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> v2: Variant = .{ .boolean = <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> v3: Variant = .none;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(v1.truthy());\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!v2.truthy());\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!v3.truthy());\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_union_method.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_union_method.test.union method...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>使用推导枚举标记类型的联合，也可以为推导出的标记指定序数值。这要求为标记显式指定整数类型。可使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#backingInt\">@backingInt</a> 访问活动字段对应的序数值。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_tagged_union_with_tag_values.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Tagged = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>)) {\n    int: <span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">123</span>,\n    boolean: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">67</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"tag values\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> int: Tagged = .{ .int = -<span class=\"tok-number\">40</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">123</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(int));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> boolean: Tagged = .{ .boolean = <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">67</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(boolean));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_tagged_union_with_tag_values.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_tagged_union_with_tag_values.test.tag values...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#tagName\">@tagName</a> 可以返回在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>表示字段名称的 <code>[:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code> 值：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_tagName.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqualSlices = std.testing.expectEqualSlices;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Small2 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>) {\n    a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>,\n    b: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n    c: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"@tagName\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqualSlices(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"a\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@tagName</span>(Small2.a));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_tagName.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_tagName.test.@tagName...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"extern-union\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#extern-union\">extern union</a></h3>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span></code> 的内存布局保证与目标 C ABI 兼容。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#extern-struct\">extern struct</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"packed-union\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#packed-union\">packed union</a></h3>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">packed</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span></code> 具有明确定义的内存布局，可以包含在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#packed-struct\">packed struct</a> 中。</p>\n      <p>紧凑联合的全部字段必须具有相同的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#bitSizeOf\">@bitSizeOf</a>。</p>\n\n      <p>紧凑联合的相等性比较会比较底层整数，并且只支持 <code>==</code> 和 <code>!=</code> 这两个<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Operators/#Operators\">运算符</a>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_packed_union_equality.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"packed union equality\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> U = <span class=\"tok-kw\">packed</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span> {\n        a: <span class=\"tok-type\">u4</span>,\n        b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i4</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x: U = .{ .a = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> y: U = .{ .b = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(x, y);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_packed_union_equality.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_packed_union_equality.test.packed union equality...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#backingInt\">@backingInt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#fromBackingInt\">@fromBackingInt</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Anonymous-Union-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#Anonymous-Union-Literals\">匿名联合字面量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>使用<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#Anonymous-Struct-Literals\">匿名结构体字面量</a>语法，可以在不指定类型的情况下初始化联合：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_anonymous_union.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Number = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span> {\n    int: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>,\n    float: <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"anonymous union literal syntax\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> i: Number = .{ .int = <span class=\"tok-number\">42</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> f = makeNumber();\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">42</span>, i.int);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">12.34</span>, f.float);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">makeNumber</span>() Number {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> .{ .float = <span class=\"tok-number\">12.34</span> };\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_anonymous_union.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_anonymous_union.test.anonymous union literal syntax...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":35,"translated":35}}
